{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act15side_level_act15side_05_beg",
  "groupId": "act15side",
  "stageId": "act15side_05",
  "title": "貨與人",
  "storyCode": "IW-5",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act15side/level_act15side_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "b47e7f389f5543b2f9c5c151f462db03605248ec3b653a837131060ae0afe95c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "5上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "山上的風，總是清爽的。\n一個清爽的早晨，總是適合解決一些不清不楚的事情。\n山間小鎮剛起炊煙，春雪未散，一老一小，相顧無言。\n只聽遠方一聲擊鑼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "等你很久了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......嘁，這傢伙......阿燈，先不要輕舉妄動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "我見過你，嗯，原來是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "的確是出人意料，一個雷姆必拓人，一個從一開始就悄悄蟄伏在尚蜀的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "我可聽不懂啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "阿燈！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "什——！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "套索？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "你把這些眠獸訓練得不錯，如果是尋常人，此刻就該倒栽蔥紮在地裡了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "（不僅能立刻發現背後的陷阱，還能穩穩把繩索踩在腳下......這老頭......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "別擔心，我不難為你一個姑娘家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "你知道你懷裡的那隻酒盞，是什麼東西嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......我不關心，也不在乎。問太多的賞金獵人，都是新手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "那就要怪你自己了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "別這麼得意！小帽！鑽頭！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "既然不知道是什麼，就老老實實把東西交出來，不要白白遭人利用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "你、你竟然對小帽——！你自找的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......無頭箭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "（用、用手抓住了？這個距離！？我可是才給弩換過弦的——！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "念在你不願意傷人性命的份上，我給你一個機會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "把這酒盞給我，然後告訴你背後的人：慎行，忌私。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "哼，你知道我背後是誰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "知不知道不重要，重要的是，我能在這條路上堵住你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......我憑什麼聽你的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "你沒得選。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "你自己也許逃得掉，但你總不忍心看見，自己飼養的這些小畜生遭了殃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "你威脅我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "你有些身手，可除了擺弄弓弩，也沒啥功夫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "大可不必敬酒不吃吃罰酒，混江湖，是要靠眼力識人的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......確實，那個人也沒和我說，會有你這樣的高手來礙事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "如果我拜託一個人去做一件危險的事，那我也多半不會全盤托出的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "外鄉人，一份工作而已，何必搭上身家性命？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "把盞給我，我以鏢局的名義擔保，那人許你多少錢財，我們雙倍奉上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......哈，本來就是虧本買賣，義務勞動。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "算是幫朋友忙吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "原來你這樣的荒野流寇，也願意為朋友兩肋插刀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "你好像對我們有點意見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......沒有的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "生意做久了，貴人多了，朋友也就少了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "那你就老老實實回去做生意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "是啊，山上的生意是最好做的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "這三山十七峰幾百條山道，哪條道上沒有供人歇腳休憩的茶館驛站，哪條道上......沒有我們的人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "望姑娘知曉輕重。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "你還真不把我放在眼裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "雖然正面開戰不是我的風格，但是都被挑釁到這個份上了......對吧，小傢伙們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "（雷姆必拓語）讓這個老傢伙知道厲害！我們摸爬滾打這麼多年，也不是吃乾飯的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "執迷不悟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "若是如此，那就得罪——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哪怕有第三個人站在一旁，他也絕對看不清這一步，是怎麼踏上前來的。\n只因為這個人擅長走路，擅長爬山。他每天抬步踏步的次數，實在是太多太多。\n一聲脆響，地上，青磚碎裂，身前，煙塵濛濛，眼旁，是一根樸素無奇的竹木扁擔，微微發青。\n遠方，又一聲擊鑼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "——怎、怎麼......這個人是從哪裡......啊，阿燈，別怕，鑽頭！快到我這裡......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......是你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "你終於上山了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "所以我來找你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "該來的總要來。躲是躲不完的。你又何必這麼著急？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "喂，小女娃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......叫我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "（他的動作——這根木條是叫扁擔來著？他剛才做了什麼......把石磚地拍得粉碎？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "你認得他？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "那就是你們之間有什麼麻煩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "我們之間只站著你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "說的對，那我就是你的麻煩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "事辦完了，我會去找你。但不是現在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......小女娃，和你手裡護著的玩意，有關係？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......啊......是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "你我私仇，別扯上這件大事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "多大的事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "百姓安危，士卒存亡！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......自從那年雨夜之後，我很少聽你有這樣的語氣了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "是啊。你怎麼會是個惡人呢。一個俠義心腸的刀客，一個本分做人的掌櫃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "那你就讓開——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "——可我正知道你是這樣一個人，所以你不來見我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "你不見我，我去找你，也沒有結果。所以我也沒有下過山。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "那如果......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......啊！你——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "還給我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......十年了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "十年前，你就是為了護這隻酒盞......看著我兒子死於非命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......尚塚！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "小女娃，這沒你什麼事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "你趁我不注意搶了我的貨，還敢說沒我事了！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "這貨本來也不是你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "尚塚，你昏頭了嗎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "沒你什麼事了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "尚塚！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "滾！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "......嘁！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜半",
      "text": "你們最好記住......我一定會把東西搶回來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "......鄭清鉞。你的刀呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "在家裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "哦。在家裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "那年雨夜，走鏢路上，共犧牲了十幾號人。其中有一個兒子，一個父親。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "兒子姓尚，是我的兒子。父親姓杜，是杜遙夜的親爹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "所以你就不戴刀了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "天大的笑話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......你恨我到現在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "我不恨你，我知道你不是故意的，責任在你，錯不在你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "“先救貨，再救人”，哼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "可貨沒了，人也沒了，難道還不許我怨你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "我必須向你討個說法，否則我活不下去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鄭掌櫃",
      "text": "......我答應你。酒盞給我。你知道，這隻酒盞牽扯——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "我不知道。當年他為這隻酒盞而死，今天，我要拿這隻酒盞給他陪葬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "挑山人",
      "text": "我在山上等你，等你去取刀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "......慎師傅！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "嗯？你們怎麼先來了？我剛打算去梁府找你們呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "鯉小子呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "那隻酒盞被偷了，鯉先生讓我們來找您來著。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "他有交代過什麼嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......他讓你們來找我，卻沒讓你們先去找那梁大人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "你們分明是從梁府出來的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "text": "呃......是的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "......唉。沒讓你們找梁洵，說明他心底裡已經知道了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老船夫",
      "text": "人精，人精，確實是人精。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "太合叔，回來了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "以她身份而言，禮數周到，名副其實。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "願意演這番禮數周到，說明還有斡旋餘地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "不論她本人做何動作，有何居心。太傅手諭在此，作不得假。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "她是個聰明人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "我既以官身拜訪，她當有所覺察。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "......好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "如今兩方都如勁弓滿弦，一觸即發。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "太合",
      "text": "唯有在惹出更多口舌非議之前，了結事端。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "如果真的要讓所有人相信，我們的選擇能讓大炎永除後患，那我們自然得依那四個字——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "左樂",
      "text": "——光明磊落。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
